msgctxt "284"
msgid "Kiryu-san... You came..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "You're still here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san, I know I have no right to ask you this, but please, don't "
"abandon me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "Man... You really are in a fix, aren't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "Well, good luck."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "So that's it? You don't have any more advice for me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid ""
"You're the one who took out those loans. You're just gonna have to figure "
"it out for yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "Oh... Now you've given up on me, too... What do I do now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid ""
"All right, fine. Just take me to the loan shark you borrowed from. I might "
"be able to work something out for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid "Really!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid "I'm already too involved. I can't just abandon you now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid "Thank you so much!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid "The loan shark we borrowed from is just this way. Follow me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid "All right. Let's see if we can hash something out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid "You're back again? Really, what is it with you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san, the loan consolidation thing turned out to be a scam, just like "
"you said. They almost got me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid "Is that so? Good on you for seeing through it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid "I don't know how I can thank you, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid "If you escaped that scam, what are you doing back here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san, the loan consolidation thing turned out to be a scam, just like "
"you said..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "668"
msgid "And you fell for it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid "Yes... And now I'm even deeper in debt..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid ""
"So you came to the decision that you needed to throw yourself in the "
"river... again?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "704"
msgid ""
"That's not the whole reason... I mean, my debts are bad, but there's "
"something else, now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "716"
msgid ""
"A friend of mine's also having debt troubles. He asked if he could borrow "
"just 10,000 yen to help pay them off. I gave it to him, as a good friend "
"should..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "728"
msgid "...But right after, this friend of mine skipped town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "740"
msgid ""
"And since I paid 10,000 yen on his loan, that loan company is holding me "
"responsible as the guarantor for my friend's loan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "752"
msgid ""
"I never even wanted to be his guarantor...\r\n"
"But now they're demanding that I pay off the rest of his loan..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "764"
msgid ""
"What the hell were you thinking? You were about to kill yourself over your "
"own debt. Why would you think you could help your friend with his?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "776"
msgid ""
"Well, he was in a lot of trouble, and I, of all people, would know how "
"stressful that kind of debt can be. I felt really bad for him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "788"
msgid "What am I going to do with you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "800"
msgid "Heh. Sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "812"
msgid "Oh, boy..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "824"
msgid "Well, good luck."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "836"
msgid "So that's it? You don't have any more advice for me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "848"
msgid ""
"You're the one who took out those loans. You're just gonna have to figure "
"it out for yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "860"
msgid "Oh... Now you've given up on me, too... What do I do now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "920"
msgid ""
"All right, fine. Just take me to the loan shark you borrowed from. I might "
"be able to work something out for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "932"
msgid "Really!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "944"
msgid "I'm already too involved. I can't just abandon you now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "956"
msgid "Thank you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "968"
msgid "The loan shark we borrowed from is just this way. Follow me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "980"
msgid "All right. Let's see if we can hash something out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1004"
msgid "(I can't just abandon him here.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1016"
msgid "(I'll cheer him up a bit, then leave.)"
msgstr ""

